WEBVTT

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:14.360
I can't take it anymore! I've had it!

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:18.140
I am so out of here!

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:54.870
Reminiscence

00:01:55.240 --> 00:01:58.320
Shino, how many times 
have you yawned now?

00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:01.890
My bad. Satomi summoned me yesterday...

00:02:02.420 --> 00:02:05.310
Sosuke's Gem of Duty has been stolen?

00:02:05.310 --> 00:02:06.020
Is that right?

00:02:07.210 --> 00:02:08.270
And...?

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:12.180
I swear that man could 
nag your ears off.

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:14.560
Thanks to him, I didn't 
get to bed until morning.

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:15.780
It serves you right!

00:02:16.430 --> 00:02:18.980
This is what you get for 
running off with Sosuke

00:02:18.980 --> 00:02:21.130
and leaving me behind like that!

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:22.650
Excuse me...

00:02:23.650 --> 00:02:26.230
Have you come across... my cat?

00:02:26.820 --> 00:02:28.650
It's the cat-lovin' geezer!

00:02:28.650 --> 00:02:30.240
Who're you calling a "geezer"?

00:02:30.570 --> 00:02:32.420
Good morning, Mr. Hinozuka.

00:02:32.780 --> 00:02:33.880
Call me Nachi.

00:02:34.410 --> 00:02:36.040
By "cat," do you mean Kaede?

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:37.760
Doesn't he come when you call?

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:39.170
You are his master.

00:02:40.710 --> 00:02:43.170
See, my cat's "special" that way...

00:02:43.170 --> 00:02:46.570
Come to think of it, was it your 
cat that screamed, "I'm leaving,"

00:02:46.570 --> 00:02:48.570
and threw a huge fit yesterday?

00:02:48.570 --> 00:02:50.170
What? He ran away?

00:02:50.630 --> 00:02:53.050
Byakko, Tenko, do you 
know anything about this?

00:02:53.220 --> 00:02:54.390
Indeed not!

00:02:54.390 --> 00:02:56.270
The very idea of ignoring one's master

00:02:56.270 --> 00:02:57.760
when he beckons is appalling.

00:02:57.760 --> 00:03:00.450
'Tis said that cats choose 
the house, not the human.

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:04.430
Yeah, and he always was half feral...

00:03:04.810 --> 00:03:06.860
Nachi, what is keeping you?

00:03:07.570 --> 00:03:10.280
Our escorts are here. We're leaving now.

00:03:10.280 --> 00:03:11.430
Right, right.

00:03:12.030 --> 00:03:14.340
Well, if he's not here, he's not here.

00:03:14.780 --> 00:03:16.020
You there, runt!

00:03:16.020 --> 00:03:18.200
If you have some free time, 
could you hunt him down?

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:19.340
Who're you calling a "runt"?!

00:03:19.660 --> 00:03:22.170
I heard Rio completely 
cut your allowance.

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:24.850
I'll give you one instead. Here!

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:30.420
Kaede likes the Old Town. Later!

00:03:31.380 --> 00:03:32.260
No...

00:03:32.260 --> 00:03:33.970
I acted on reflex...

00:03:34.390 --> 00:03:36.060
I wish you the best, Shii!

00:03:36.060 --> 00:03:37.360
Good luck finding Kaede.

00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:43.010
I've only been away for half a year,

00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:44.680
but the Imperial Capital 
has certainly changed

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:45.790
during my brief excursion...

00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:46.960
That's why I said that I'm sorry!

00:03:47.730 --> 00:03:50.640
And this is how you show your remorse?

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:53.780
First you skip work and remain 
out of contact for days on end,

00:03:53.780 --> 00:03:55.130
and now I hear that you were hurt!

00:03:55.570 --> 00:03:57.000
It has already healed!

00:03:57.370 --> 00:03:59.680
We are imposing upon the 
innkeeper at Kona-ya and

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:01.220
you've caused her unnecessary concern!

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:02.010
Really!

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:03.420
My, my, my!

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:05.760
It's said that the 
Demon Princess normally

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:07.060
hides out deep in the mountains,

00:04:07.060 --> 00:04:09.600
so what brings her to 
the Imperial Capital?

00:04:12.260 --> 00:04:14.970
Crap, that was close! 
She almost spotted me!

00:04:14.970 --> 00:04:17.900
I hate women since they never 
seem to let bygones be bygones!

00:04:24.140 --> 00:04:26.410
But that truly was an usual sight...

00:04:27.020 --> 00:04:30.770
I can't believe that warped 
woman adopted a human...

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:36.990
Aw, jeez! He is so horrendously noisy!

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:39.410
But that's how dogs normally act.

00:04:40.240 --> 00:04:42.800
I wish Yattsuan could take a 
hint or two from this mutt.

00:04:46.670 --> 00:04:48.300
Hey, you!

00:04:48.310 --> 00:04:50.510
How dare you eat my shadow 
without permission?!

00:04:50.510 --> 00:04:51.590
The nerve!

00:04:51.590 --> 00:04:53.810
H-hey! Wait! Stop! Stop that!

00:04:54.170 --> 00:04:57.690
Hey, knock that off! Stop right there!

00:04:57.690 --> 00:05:00.940
KONA-YA

00:04:58.890 --> 00:05:00.940
Goodness! Is there a problem, Shino?

00:05:01.130 --> 00:05:02.320
Why don't you come in?

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:04.950
Aren't you with Sosuke today?

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:06.930
Mew!

00:05:07.390 --> 00:05:10.020
So has work at the church.

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:12.190
I brought a little something.

00:05:12.190 --> 00:05:14.940
There were a bunch in the yard 
at the manor, so I grabbed some.

00:05:15.240 --> 00:05:16.710
Why thank you!

00:05:17.740 --> 00:05:19.960
These chestnuts are beautiful.

00:05:20.530 --> 00:05:23.990
That aside, Ma'am, when 
did you adopt that cat?

00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:26.830
Oh, it's nothing like that!

00:05:26.830 --> 00:05:28.790
Genpachi just dropped it off.

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:31.420
He asked me to watch over 
it since he knows the owner.

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:34.220
Shino, do you happen to 
know this cat as well?

00:05:34.460 --> 00:05:38.010
Uh, I guess you could say I know it...

00:05:38.010 --> 00:05:40.470
In fact, you could say 
I was looking for it...

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:42.930
Really? Then this works out perfectly!

00:05:42.930 --> 00:05:45.980
Could you watch it until 
Genpachi gets back?

00:05:46.850 --> 00:05:49.270
Some delicious meat just came in today.

00:05:49.270 --> 00:05:51.770
How does that and steamed 
rice with chestnuts sound?

00:05:52.230 --> 00:05:53.980
I love cats!

00:05:53.980 --> 00:05:54.750
Love!

00:05:55.280 --> 00:05:56.560
Come to think of it,

00:05:56.560 --> 00:05:59.750
sorry 'bout how I asked you to 
suddenly hire Takanobu and Saki.

00:06:00.070 --> 00:06:01.320
Not at all!

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:03.880
Both of them are very 
earnest, hard workers!

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:05.300
They're a great help.

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:07.760
Don't they have a 
younger sister as well?

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:11.560
Right. Yana is attending 
the same school as Hamaji.

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:13.260
Is that right?

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:16.550
Well, I'm gonna dig in!

00:06:16.550 --> 00:06:18.010
Me too!

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:29.990
Stop right there!

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:31.900
Why is your meal clearly 
superior to mine?!

00:06:32.190 --> 00:06:34.280
I happen to be a glorious human.

00:06:34.480 --> 00:06:37.410
Then what is so glorious 
about that crow?! Well?!

00:06:38.740 --> 00:06:40.280
Fine, then...

00:06:40.280 --> 00:06:41.670
This meat's good!

00:06:43.700 --> 00:06:45.170
Mew!

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:48.630
I'm amazed at how the Old Town

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:50.680
has changed in the short 
time I've been away.

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:54.680
Even during the day, there are 
strange spirits wandering about!

00:06:54.960 --> 00:06:56.290
And this inn!

00:06:56.290 --> 00:06:59.060
For some odd reason, it 
outright stinks of demons.

00:06:59.260 --> 00:07:00.800
No kidding!

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:04.220
That aside, your master, 
Nachi, was looking for you.

00:07:04.220 --> 00:07:06.320
I seriously can't stand that manor!

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:10.190
There is the TREACHEROUS Master 
Chikage, the SUPER aloof Yattsuan

00:07:10.190 --> 00:07:13.020
and FIVE foxes that act 
like brother-in-laws!

00:07:13.020 --> 00:07:16.330
How am I supposed to find 
an area to call my own?!

00:07:17.320 --> 00:07:18.940
That place is huge.

00:07:18.940 --> 00:07:20.330
Couldn't you find a place 
large enough to nap?

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:22.080
That isn't the issue!

00:07:22.700 --> 00:07:25.090
I need my own territory! Ter-ri-tory!

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:26.590
Yeah, well, you are a cat.

00:07:26.780 --> 00:07:29.090
Exactly! But that manor is-

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:35.720
WHAT THE BLAZES IS THAT?!

00:07:35.880 --> 00:07:38.000
Let me introduce him. This is Megu.

00:07:40.010 --> 00:07:42.320
It's kinda creepy looking...

00:07:42.320 --> 00:07:43.730
Is that your pet, Dearie?

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:46.250
It ain't mine! He belongs to Genpachi.

00:07:46.600 --> 00:07:49.180
Oh, you mean that rather 
quirky Raiki, right?

00:07:50.060 --> 00:07:53.960
But this creature just tried to eat me!

00:07:53.960 --> 00:07:57.600
It had the gall to bite the 
great and mighty Kaede!

00:08:05.950 --> 00:08:08.850
Huh? What's wrong with me?

00:08:08.850 --> 00:08:10.960
I didn't resume my original form, did I?

00:08:10.960 --> 00:08:13.380
Kaede, it's gone.

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:14.890
It's gone? What's gone?

00:08:15.170 --> 00:08:15.790
Your shadow!

00:08:17.420 --> 00:08:19.250
Oh, it musta been the Shadow Eaters.

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:22.640
Curse those wretched spirits!

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:27.230
Chill. I heard it'll come 
back on the next full moon.

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:29.220
And that's the worst these critters do.

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:30.970
Not funny!

00:08:30.970 --> 00:08:34.050
How will I survive in this 
puny form until then?

00:08:34.050 --> 00:08:35.190
What's the big deal?

00:08:35.190 --> 00:08:37.230
You can deal until the next full moon!

00:08:37.230 --> 00:08:39.660
I've been stuck like this 
for five whole years.

00:08:39.900 --> 00:08:40.910
Five years?

00:08:41.230 --> 00:08:42.000
Five years.

00:08:45.990 --> 00:08:48.370
Murasame, you may eat him.

00:08:48.370 --> 00:08:49.370
Roger!

00:08:49.370 --> 00:08:51.550
I was just teasing! I'll stop laughing!

00:08:51.990 --> 00:08:54.720
You know, they say that 
cats aren't very tasty.

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:55.710
I'm really sorry.

00:08:55.710 --> 00:08:56.550
Damn!

00:08:57.500 --> 00:08:58.680
But I was wondering,

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:01.310
if the Church knows 
that you have Murasame,

00:09:01.590 --> 00:09:04.810
is it wise for you to walk 
around town out in the open?

00:09:05.170 --> 00:09:07.570
With all these people in 
the Imperial Capital,

00:09:07.570 --> 00:09:10.070
won't they have a hard time 
finding me in a crowd?

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:12.470
Well, you do have a point.

00:09:12.470 --> 00:09:15.930
Besides, Satomi asked me to 
hunt something down for him.

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:17.600
What are you looking for?

00:09:18.350 --> 00:09:19.610
Oh, these.

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:23.080
Devotion

00:09:23.570 --> 00:09:24.610
A ball?

00:09:24.610 --> 00:09:26.650
Including this, there 
are eight in total.

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:32.580
But if you're looking for balls 
that release such strong auras,

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:35.000
they may be surprisingly close by.

00:09:35.290 --> 00:09:37.720
I think I can sense them!

00:09:38.210 --> 00:09:40.970
No way! You can tell where the gems are?

00:09:41.290 --> 00:09:44.730
Yeah! But not when I'm 
stuck in this form.

00:09:45.860 --> 00:09:48.090
You'll have to wait for 
the next full moon!

00:09:50.140 --> 00:09:52.260
Well, we've got plenty of time.

00:09:52.260 --> 00:09:55.560
I think I'd like sea bream 
sashimi for dinner tonight.

00:09:58.100 --> 00:09:59.980
Say, Dearie?

00:09:59.980 --> 00:10:03.870
Aimlessly walking around town 
won't help you find the balls.

00:10:04.350 --> 00:10:05.730
That's okay.

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:08.370
I'll never find them if 
I hang out in that room.

00:10:08.860 --> 00:10:12.240
I'm more likely to find them if 
I go outside for a bit, right?

00:10:12.240 --> 00:10:14.380
You sure are optimistic...

00:10:15.410 --> 00:10:18.230
He most certainly is a unique child!

00:10:18.790 --> 00:10:21.210
Normally when someone serves 
as a host for Murasame,

00:10:21.210 --> 00:10:23.390
that person ultimately 
winds up getting devoured.

00:10:23.670 --> 00:10:26.350
So why is this child fit as a fiddle?

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:28.340
Murasame, how 'bout we grab some grub?

00:10:28.340 --> 00:10:29.400
Yeah!

00:10:29.700 --> 00:10:33.080
Time froze when he was a boy 
and he is unable to die.

00:10:33.080 --> 00:10:35.970
He has neither parents, nor 
a village whence to return.

00:10:37.660 --> 00:10:41.060
Eventually his friends will die 
and he will be alone in the world.

00:10:41.060 --> 00:10:42.300
Aren't you afraid?

00:10:45.900 --> 00:10:47.410
Excuse me, Mr. Satomi.

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:51.000
After I pick up Shino, I 
am going home for the day.

00:10:51.350 --> 00:10:52.670
Did he visit Kona-ya again?

00:10:52.870 --> 00:10:53.660
Probably.

00:10:54.960 --> 00:10:56.080
Sosuke...

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:56.670
Yes?

00:10:57.820 --> 00:10:59.910
I heard that you have met your shadow.

00:11:00.330 --> 00:11:01.750
Have you suffered any 
changes since then?

00:11:03.570 --> 00:11:04.430
I have not.

00:11:05.710 --> 00:11:07.530
When did that start with your left hand?

00:11:12.840 --> 00:11:14.490
It doesn't "hardly" hurt.

00:11:14.490 --> 00:11:16.360
I can't feel any pain at all.

00:11:16.820 --> 00:11:18.320
And here this is a rather 
serious injury...

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:21.060
I believe it was about a month ago.

00:11:21.590 --> 00:11:24.300
Thus far, it has not proved 
to be an inconvenience,

00:11:24.300 --> 00:11:26.360
so I didn't think much of it.

00:11:27.280 --> 00:11:28.380
If you'll excuse me.

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:39.090
That hand is merely the prelude.

00:11:40.510 --> 00:11:43.330
As he defeats spirits 
and steals their power,

00:11:43.330 --> 00:11:45.690
the half of Sosuke who 
now possesses the gem

00:11:46.530 --> 00:11:48.750
will most likely continue 
to grow in strength.

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:51.760
Duty

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:51.520
The gems choose their owners.

00:11:53.150 --> 00:11:56.510
What do you desire, Sosuke?

00:11:57.730 --> 00:11:59.060
Yer eatin' before ya leave, right?

00:11:59.060 --> 00:12:00.470
You bet!

00:12:00.470 --> 00:12:03.160
Meat! Meat! Meat! Meat!

00:12:02.840 --> 00:12:03.900
Right, right.

00:12:04.850 --> 00:12:06.810
That's all you ever want.

00:12:06.810 --> 00:12:08.440
I'm still growin'!

00:12:08.770 --> 00:12:09.800
Goodness me!

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:11.660
I must have fallen sound asleep!

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:13.670
KONA-YA

00:12:12.600 --> 00:12:13.670
Good evening!

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:16.660
Welcome back!

00:12:16.660 --> 00:12:18.280
I figured you'd be here.

00:12:18.280 --> 00:12:18.920
Yo!

00:12:19.270 --> 00:12:21.660
Are you already helping 
yourself to dinner?

00:12:21.660 --> 00:12:24.330
Don't worry! I prepared enough for you!

00:12:24.330 --> 00:12:26.430
That really isn't the issue...

00:12:26.700 --> 00:12:27.980
It's been a while since we've done this.

00:12:27.980 --> 00:12:29.350
Why don't you let it slide?

00:12:29.350 --> 00:12:32.430
I'm off tomorrow, so come drink with me!

00:12:33.340 --> 00:12:36.440
I'm sorry, but as a minor, 
I really shouldn't drink...

00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:39.440
What is with that reaction?

00:12:39.760 --> 00:12:40.970
He's old for his age!

00:12:40.970 --> 00:12:42.270
Ain't he?

00:12:42.560 --> 00:12:43.700
Back off!

00:12:44.880 --> 00:12:47.570
What's this? I thought I heard a party!

00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:48.700
Let me in on the fun.

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:51.150
Hey, Keno! What about work?

00:12:51.150 --> 00:12:55.570
Finished! Filling the 
customer's cups isn't my job.

00:12:55.570 --> 00:12:56.710
And besides,

00:12:57.190 --> 00:12:58.840
I'm a minor.

00:12:59.870 --> 00:13:01.840
What's with that reaction?!

00:13:02.270 --> 00:13:03.390
Goodness me!

00:13:03.390 --> 00:13:05.690
If it isn't the Demon 
Princess' adopted son.

00:13:05.690 --> 00:13:08.290
And we've got Raiki 
and Fuki here as well.

00:13:08.290 --> 00:13:10.040
Oh, yeah! I just remembered.

00:13:10.170 --> 00:13:12.850
Genpachi, I heard you found this guy.

00:13:13.670 --> 00:13:15.880
I was actually looking for 
him, so thanks for the help!

00:13:15.880 --> 00:13:17.130
Mew!

00:13:17.430 --> 00:13:20.360
Oh, so I was right when I 
assumed he was Hinozuka's cat.

00:13:20.720 --> 00:13:23.360
Isn't he acting a bit 
calm to be his cat?

00:13:23.640 --> 00:13:26.520
This punk let the Shadow 
Eaters gobble up his shadow!

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:29.370
Isn't this a normal cat?

00:13:29.650 --> 00:13:32.520
Now that I look closer, I 
see that he has two tails.

00:13:32.520 --> 00:13:35.290
I'm not a freak show! Mew!

00:13:35.740 --> 00:13:36.870
He talked!

00:13:37.070 --> 00:13:39.900
Put me down!

00:13:39.240 --> 00:13:41.070
Look! He can really stretch out!

00:13:40.440 --> 00:13:41.070
Hey!

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:42.800
Do you realize who I am?!

00:13:43.160 --> 00:13:45.460
Keno, he is more or less a god...

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:46.210
It's not like you'll lose 
anything by letting me hold you.

00:13:46.210 --> 00:13:47.160
What do you mean by, "more or less"?!

00:13:47.160 --> 00:13:48.420
You're so fluffy!

00:13:48.420 --> 00:13:49.790
No!

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:03.150
KONA-YA

00:14:02.180 --> 00:14:03.150
Pardon me!

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:06.150
What a surprise! If it isn't Daikaku.

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:08.480
It's been a while, Ma'am.

00:14:08.480 --> 00:14:10.160
I spoke with Inukai the other day-

00:14:10.380 --> 00:14:12.750
Skip those stiff formalities 
and come inside.

00:14:13.110 --> 00:14:14.410
Come along, now!

00:14:14.650 --> 00:14:16.490
Wow, long time no see!

00:14:16.490 --> 00:14:17.670
Oh, you came!

00:14:17.670 --> 00:14:19.700
You seem to be enjoying yourselves.

00:14:20.530 --> 00:14:22.270
Keno, is this your 
first time meeting him?

00:14:23.240 --> 00:14:24.010
Yeah.

00:14:24.650 --> 00:14:27.120
I'm Daikaku Inumura.
 It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:29.370
I'm Keno Inusaka. It's a pleasure.

00:14:29.620 --> 00:14:31.550
Dudes, this ain't a match-makin' party!

00:14:32.030 --> 00:14:35.790
You see, I am thinking about 
moving here soon so that

00:14:35.790 --> 00:14:37.560
my younger sister may attend school.

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:39.440
Genpachi told me everythin'!

00:14:39.880 --> 00:14:43.070
Ma said you should stay here 
until yer all settled in.

00:14:43.070 --> 00:14:45.850
Thanks, but I'd hate to impose on you...

00:14:45.850 --> 00:14:48.350
What gives? You've been 
doing nothin' but sleeping.

00:14:48.640 --> 00:14:50.570
It is practically a cat's job to sleep.

00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:52.650
Sounds just like you, Shino!

00:14:52.650 --> 00:14:54.060
Eat, sleep and play!

00:14:54.060 --> 00:14:55.330
What was that?!

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:58.330
What the heck?! Sosuke, not you too!

00:14:58.570 --> 00:14:59.450
You're right!

00:14:59.450 --> 00:15:00.860
You said it!

00:15:00.860 --> 00:15:01.660
Sosuke-

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:03.870
What's wrong?

00:15:03.870 --> 00:15:04.810
I just remembered!

00:15:04.810 --> 00:15:07.130
That there Daikaku has 
a ball just like the one

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:09.340
you're carrying around, Dearie!

00:15:09.560 --> 00:15:10.540
What?!

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:11.870
What gives, Shino?

00:15:11.870 --> 00:15:14.540
You keep goin' on about "gems" 
and "balls." All guys got 'em!

00:15:14.540 --> 00:15:17.350
No, not necessarily! I'm 
not so sure about Shino.

00:15:18.130 --> 00:15:21.350
What're you talking about?! 
This is what I meant!

00:15:21.370 --> 00:15:23.860
Gratitude

00:15:22.340 --> 00:15:23.450
Is this what you meant?

00:15:23.860 --> 00:15:25.180
What?!

00:15:25.180 --> 00:15:27.360
Is it supposed to be rare?

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:29.520
Daikaku, you have one, too?

00:15:29.520 --> 00:15:32.240
What? You've been searching 
for these, Shino?

00:15:32.560 --> 00:15:35.230
This is becoming less 
and less rare, huh?

00:15:35.230 --> 00:15:36.280
Isn't it?

00:15:36.280 --> 00:15:38.500
Huh? Sosuke, you don't have one?

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:41.570
Thanks to a certain 
someone, mine was stolen.

00:15:41.570 --> 00:15:43.440
You're quite the fool, aren't you?

00:15:43.440 --> 00:15:44.500
Shut it.

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:46.910
Devotion Wisdom Integrity 
Gratitude Fraternity

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:53.120
Dearie, aren't we going back inside?

00:15:56.290 --> 00:16:00.090
Hm, well, it isn't a 
full moon, but it'll do.

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:06.520
You've finally shown 
yourself, Shadow Eater.

00:16:07.530 --> 00:16:09.530
Give Kaede's shadow back.

00:16:09.850 --> 00:16:10.780
Otherwise...

00:16:11.770 --> 00:16:13.910
...I'll devour you and all of your kind!

00:16:25.140 --> 00:16:28.420
Well, I appreciate how I'll be able 
to return to my proper form now...

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:31.200
I'm the one who owes you a thank you!

00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:33.180
Thanks to you, Kaede, I was able 
to find a bunch of the gems.

00:16:33.370 --> 00:16:36.630
Just two- No, you said 
three left, right?

00:16:36.880 --> 00:16:38.430
Are you going to keep the hunt up?

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:41.550
You bet! I'll keep searching 
until I find all eight.

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:49.200
Ah, that's right. I liked it 
when he smiled like this...

00:16:52.850 --> 00:16:54.340
Darn that Shino!

00:16:54.340 --> 00:16:56.320
I wonder if he plans on 
staying out all night again.

00:16:57.810 --> 00:16:59.820
Say, Hamaji! Did you know?

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:01.190
Know what?

00:17:01.190 --> 00:17:03.480
Normally children chosen 
by the Sacred Beasts

00:17:03.480 --> 00:17:05.480
are decided upon before 
they are ever born.

00:17:05.490 --> 00:17:07.580
We are always together 
until the day we die.

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:09.590
Is that right?

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:12.120
But that isn't true of Nachi and Kaede.

00:17:12.710 --> 00:17:17.340
Kaede originally chose 
Nachi's older brother, Yuri.

00:17:18.370 --> 00:17:20.850
Why did he suddenly switch to Nachi?

00:17:23.210 --> 00:17:25.380
Yuri lacked the sight.

00:17:25.810 --> 00:17:27.010
To see what?

00:17:27.010 --> 00:17:28.860
The Sacred Beasts.

00:17:29.370 --> 00:17:30.510
So even though he had

00:17:30.510 --> 00:17:33.460
been told that he was chosen 
by one of the Sacred Beasts,

00:17:33.460 --> 00:17:34.990
it didn't seem real to him.

00:17:35.810 --> 00:17:37.870
He didn't understand 
why he was forced to

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:39.410
leave the Hinozuka manor.

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:40.990
The poor dear...

00:17:41.360 --> 00:17:44.580
However, the barrier around 
this manor is quite unique.

00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:48.360
Once you're inside, 
you can suddenly see

00:17:48.360 --> 00:17:50.630
things you couldn't see before.

00:17:51.410 --> 00:17:54.700
Yuri was unable to accept that change...

00:17:55.130 --> 00:17:57.220
He locked himself within his own world.

00:17:57.790 --> 00:18:00.130
When the person they possess 
denies their existence,

00:18:00.130 --> 00:18:02.560
a Sacred Beast loses 
its purpose in life.

00:18:03.420 --> 00:18:07.040
Even for them, that is truly terrifying.

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:10.180
On the other hand,

00:18:10.180 --> 00:18:12.630
his younger brother, Nachi, 
was able to see Kaede.

00:18:13.350 --> 00:18:16.430
Since Nachi seemed to be 
a more reasonable match,

00:18:16.430 --> 00:18:18.340
Kaede changed his mind 
and switched to Nachi.

00:18:21.230 --> 00:18:25.790
Yuri left and this time Kaede 
returned to the manor with Nachi.

00:18:26.400 --> 00:18:30.220
In that case, how is Hinozuka's 
brother doing now?

00:18:33.100 --> 00:18:34.280
He passed away...

00:18:36.570 --> 00:18:37.880
I wonder...

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:39.930
Did I make a mistake 
somewhere along the line?

00:18:40.810 --> 00:18:44.070
I only did what I did because I 
wanted to see him smile, and yet...

00:18:52.890 --> 00:18:54.470
Yo! Welcome back.

00:18:58.980 --> 00:19:02.230
My prodigal cat, did 
you enjoy your walk?

00:19:02.230 --> 00:19:03.450
It was decent.

00:19:04.380 --> 00:19:06.820
I see. I'm glad you enjoyed yourself.

00:19:14.320 --> 00:19:15.210
What's the matter?

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:20.470
Nachi, didn't it bother you 
when I decided to possess you?

00:19:23.000 --> 00:19:24.300
Why would it?

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:27.470
You had been with Yuri 
since before I was born.

00:19:28.590 --> 00:19:30.760
Even though I was with 
Yuri since the moment

00:19:30.760 --> 00:19:33.430
he was born, he never grew to like me.

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:37.180
He used to smile so much...

00:19:37.180 --> 00:19:40.270
Yet the moment he gained 
the ability to see me,

00:19:40.270 --> 00:19:41.600
those smiles came to an end.

00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:47.570
After that, he sealed his eyes, 
his ears and even his mind...

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:50.530
It was why I decided to leave him...

00:19:51.930 --> 00:19:55.310
Yuri, I am going to leave 
you today and possess

00:19:55.310 --> 00:19:56.750
your younger brother, Nachi.

00:19:57.620 --> 00:20:01.290
From this day forth, you 
will never see me again.

00:20:01.870 --> 00:20:03.580
You will never hear my voice.

00:20:03.580 --> 00:20:04.700
You will be free.

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:09.020
Where did I go wrong?

00:20:09.970 --> 00:20:13.190
You didn't do anything wrong, Kaede.

00:20:14.930 --> 00:20:16.590
The Church took me in as a

00:20:16.590 --> 00:20:19.220
member of the Four Houses 
of the Sacred Beasts

00:20:19.220 --> 00:20:21.530
and Yuri returned to the Hinozuka manor.

00:20:22.730 --> 00:20:27.030
For the first time, Yuri was alone 
in the real meaning of the word.

00:20:27.980 --> 00:20:30.230
He could no longer hear your voice.

00:20:30.230 --> 00:20:31.860
He could no longer see you.

00:20:31.860 --> 00:20:33.280
I wasn't there, either.

00:20:33.280 --> 00:20:35.750
"I no longer have anyone 
to stand by my side."

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:37.520
Perhaps that is what he thought.

00:20:41.560 --> 00:20:43.630
I was always jealous of him.

00:20:45.130 --> 00:20:47.430
Jealous of how you protected Yuri.

00:20:47.920 --> 00:20:51.820
So when you chose me, I was happy.

00:20:52.610 --> 00:20:53.770
But I knew the truth!

00:20:54.630 --> 00:20:57.080
You made that decision 
for one person only.

00:20:57.570 --> 00:20:59.260
It was for Yuri, wasn't it?

00:21:01.850 --> 00:21:02.820
Ah, I...

00:21:03.810 --> 00:21:06.460
H-hey, Kaede?

00:21:06.460 --> 00:21:09.280
I certainly went through 
a lot today, didn't I?

00:21:07.230 --> 00:21:09.280
H-hey, you're heavy!

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:12.000
Perhaps it's because I've been enjoying

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:14.000
semi-retirement these past few months,

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:17.160
but the Imperial Capital comes 
across as dreadfully noisy!

00:21:18.800 --> 00:21:22.090
The dearie possessed by Murasame 
seems as chipper as ever.

00:21:22.490 --> 00:21:23.840
The dog man and the

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:26.940
demons are enjoying lives 
mingling amongst the humans.

00:21:27.670 --> 00:21:30.000
There were some hiccups along the way,

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:31.830
but that doll was still smiling.

00:21:35.880 --> 00:21:37.600
Kaede...!

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:39.600
C'mon, what's gotten into you?

00:21:39.600 --> 00:21:41.220
I'm here with Nachi!

00:21:42.540 --> 00:21:46.350
Y-you see, Kaede, you're h-heavy!

00:21:46.980 --> 00:21:51.110
I think this just might 
be what you call "bliss"!

00:21:53.190 --> 00:21:55.140
That's why I said you're heavy...

00:23:26.010 --> 00:23:41.020
Chance Encounters

00:23:26.740 --> 00:23:27.760
I'm Kaede!

00:23:27.760 --> 00:23:30.760
I am by far the most beautiful 
of the Sacred Beasts!

00:23:31.580 --> 00:23:33.970
And why are you saying that to yourself?

00:23:34.690 --> 00:23:37.250
Talking to your reflection in the 
mirror is one of the joys of life!

00:23:37.250 --> 00:23:38.550
Don't interfere!

00:23:38.550 --> 00:23:40.650
You're cute...
